nl on disk, parser needs a look). 63/130 sessions thin (<200 chars extractable) → ledgered skipped_thin, not guessed.\n\n**Observability**: workspace longview/status.json heartbeat + ledger.jsonl (only source of reported numbers) + `longview.mjs report`. EventBus has NO external publish surface — MAP loop can't feed the activity chip in v1.\n\nRelated: [[project-prime-silo-offload-orchestrator]], [[prime-silo-togaf-report-manifest-fixes]], [[memo-ray-token-audit-validation]]\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":15,"oldLines":6,"newStart":15,"newLines":10,"lines":[" "," **Data reality (2026-07-02)**: Antigravity brain at ~/.gemini/antigravity/brain (111 dirs, 852MB; +104 in antigravity-backup NOT in memo-ray config); conversations are protobuf (unparsed, 305MB); only 6 have transcript.jsonl; 115 md artifacts. memo-ray store: 130 sessions (123 AG + 7 Claude — Claude undercounts vs 36 jsonl on disk, parser needs a look). 63/130 sessions thin (<200 chars extractable) → ledgered skipped_thin, not guessed."," ","-**Observability**: workspace longview/status.json heartbeat + ledger.jsonl (only source of reported numbers) + `longview.mjs report`. EventBus has NO external publish surface — MAP loop can't feed the activity chip in v1.","+**Observability**: workspace longview/status.json heartbeat + ledger.jsonl (only source of reported numbers) + `longview.mjs report`. EventBus has NO external publish surface — MAP loop can't feed the activity chip in v1. Phase D /rag/ingest + TOGAF swarm DO run in the runtime → visible in Mission Control."," ","+**Pilot verified (2026-07-02)**: 4 cards ok / 0 failed / 4 thin-skipped through live qwen3.5-9b-FLM (NPU): 144s cold, 54-77s warm ≈ 39 cards/hour → full 130-session backlog ≈ 3.2h. Resume (ledger skip) verified. /rag/ingest landed 40 chunks/4 docs in longview collection (run 16fe485c).","+","+**Gotchas learned**: (1) the RUNNING runtime's home ≠ repo .benny_home — it resolves via desktop config to `%APPDATA%\\space-agent\\benny-home\\be