{"parentUuid":"25ae21ca-291b-4fac-ba39-73991045debf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01Hp2nbbA8kb12SNJat9rNgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017BmoYzSi8X37sRe8NbA9Yb","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\scripts\\longview\\README.md","old_string":"## The backlog run (leave it overnight)\n\n```powershell\ncd prime-silo\nnode scripts/longview/longview.mjs all\n```\n\nResume-safe at card granularity: Ctrl+C anytime, rerun the same command, it\ncontinues where the ledger says it stopped. Progress:\n\n```powershell\nnode scripts/longview/longview.mjs status   # live heartbeat (phase, ETA, rates)\nnode scripts/longview/longview.mjs report   # honest ledger report\n```\n\n## The delta run (keeping it current)\n\n```powershell\nnode scripts/longview/longview.mjs delta            # only new/changed sessions\nnode scripts/longview/longview.mjs delta --refresh  # force deliverable re-synthesis\n```\n\nReduce re-runs automatically once ≥5 new cards accumulate (`LONGVIEW_DELTA_THRESHOLD`).","new_string":"## Manifest mode (the managed way — use this)\n\nThe pipeline definition of record is\n`runtime/manifests/templates/longview_synthesis.json` (variables + phases).\nRun and manage it from the Benny CLI:\n\n```powershell\ncd prime-silo/runtime\npython benny_cli.py longview run                  # all enabled phases, resume-safe\npython benny_cli.py longview run --phase model    # one phase\npython benny_cli.py longview run --delta          # only new/changed sessions\npython benny_cli.py longview status               # live heartbeat (phase, ETA, rates)\npython benny_cli.py longview report               # honest ledger report\n```\n\n(Equivalent direct form: `node scripts/longview/longview.mjs run [manifest] [--phase X] [--delta]`.)\nPer ADR-005 §4 the manifest's tasks are the five *phases* — the per-session\nfan-out stays inside the map phase's checkpointed loop, never as swarm tasks.\nEdit the manifest to change model, budgets, batch sizes, or to disable phases.\n\nResume-safe at card granularity: Ctrl+C anytime, rerun the same command, it\ncontinues where the ledger says it stopped. Delta reduce re-runs automatically\nonce ≥5 new cards accumulate (`delta_reduce_threshold`).\n\n## Graph ingestion (deep synthesis)\n\n`deep_synthesis: true` in the manifest is what turns card docs into\nDocument/Concept nodes in Neo4j — without it `/rag/ingest` writes **vectors\nonly** and the knowledge-graph views stay empty (found live: 55 cards in\nChroma, zero graph nodes). Synthesis is LLM-per-document, so ingest batches\nare small (`ingest_batch_size: 5`) and slow; the phase is idempotent (old\nvectors per source are deleted before re-add), so re-running `--phase model`\nafter clearing `longview/rollups/ingested.json` back-fills the graph."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":352905,"output_tokens":1395,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":352,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1395,"cache_read_input_tokens":352905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":352,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":352},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcdPHaH6C5F3jQXtB8HpN","attributionMcpServer":"prime-silo-nexus","attributionMcpTool":"get_graph_stats","type":"assistant","uuid":"95f039ab-4348-436b-b6d8-d6903d540258","timestamp":"2026-07-02T14:26:01.520Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\runtime","sessionId":"79f3f47a-9f9d-4a1f-b922-ef7b2aa390a9","version":"2.