 (`query_graph`) — the SAD is\nonly as good as what's been ingested. Two strong feeds:\n\n- **Documents**: ingest PDFs/markdown with deep synthesis (Bridge → Documents →\n  Ingest, or `/api/rag/ingest` with `deep_synthesis: true`).\n- **LONGVIEW corpus**: after a LONGVIEW run, the `longview` workspace holds the\n  session-card graph — run this swarm with `--var workspace=longview` and a\n  topic like \"The binary16 application estate\" (the exact command is written to\n  `data_out/TOGAF-RUN.md` by the LONGVIEW reduce phase). See\n  [LONGVIEW_GUIDE.md](LONGVIEW_GUIDE.md).\n\n## Verify\n\n- `benny runs ls` shows the run completed; inspect stages with `benny runs show <run_id>`.\n- The output file exists, is near `word_count_target`, and its Baseline section\n  reflects graph content (spot-check a claim against the graph or source docs).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2416,"cache_read_input_tokens":391279,"output_tokens":1347,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2416,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":440,"output_tokens":1347,"cache_read_input_tokens":391279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2416},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcdQoqyrYGyBQqUxZPNVr","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_session","attributionMcpTool":"mark_chapter","type":"assistant","uuid":"39137c60-3a2d-4e6a-aa7d-4c08e3b6d33c","timestamp":"2026-07-02T14:45:58.493Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo","sessionId":"79f3f47a-9f9d-4a1f-b922-ef7b2aa390a9","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
