nk (resume proof)\npython benny_cli.py longview run              # 3. full backlog, walk away\npython benny_cli.py longview status           # heartbeat: phase, ETA\npython benny_cli.py longview report           # ledger truth: throughput, failures\npython benny_cli.py longview run --phase model  # graph ingestion only\npython benny_cli.py longview run --delta      # afterwards: keep it current\n```\n\nThen verify the graph has **Concept nodes** (Bridge knowledge graph or `get_graph_stats(workspace=\"longview\")`) — Chroma chunks alone are not the graph — and spot-check one deliverable's session-id citations against its card. The full checklist with expected numbers is in the guide.\n\n## Still running right now\n\nThe two orphaned synthesis tasks from before the fetch fix are finishing server-side (batch progress visible in `/api/tasks`); my waiter then relaunches the fixed model phase automatically, which re-ingests all 55 cards with deep synthesis over the next couple of hours. The graph already shows Concepts from the first cards, and I'll be notified if a batch fails. One open thread for later: the 12 map-failed sessions retry with `benny longview run --phase map`, and the memo-ray Claude undercount (7 of 36 transcripts) still has its fix-task chip pending — after that fix, one `--delta` run folds the recovered history in."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":997,"cache_read_input_tokens":414853,"output_tokens":1247,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":997,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1247,"cache_read_input_tokens":414853,"cache_creation_input_tokens":997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":997},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"