{"parentUuid":"2d4b78b9-7a18-4340-9583-6e23256914fd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\scripts\\longview\\prompts\\session_card.md","snippet":"1\tYou are an archivist analyzing one working session between a software operator and an AI coding agent. Your job is to distill WHAT WAS REALLY GOING ON into a structured card. Be concrete and specific; never invent facts not present in the evidence. If something is unclear, omit it rather than guess.\n2\t\n3\tReturn ONLY a JSON object with exactly these fields:\n4\t\n5\t{\n6\t\"project\": \"short name of the project/app worked on (e.g. 'prime-silo', 'memo-ray')\",\n7\t\"period\": \"YYYY-MM (from the session dates)\",\n8\t\"intent\": \"1-3 sentences: what the operator was trying to achieve, in plain language\",\n9\t\"applications\": [\"applications/products touched or built\"],\n10\t\"capabilities\": [\"technical capabilities exercised or created, e.g. 'RAG ingestion', 'release CI'\"],\n11\t\"decisions\": [\"notable decisions made and why, if stated\"],\n12\t\"outcomes\": [\"what actually got done/shipped/verified\"],\n13\t\"failures\": [\"what failed, got stuck, or was abandoned\"],\n14\t\"skills_observed\": [\"reusable techniques/workflows demonstrated in this session\"],\n15\t\"operator_traits\": [\"working preferences the operator showed, e.g. 'demands measured claims over assertions'\"],\n16\t\"open_threads\": [\"explicitly unfinished work or stated TODOs\"],\n17\t\"proposed_next\": [\"logical next steps grounded in this session\"],\n18\t\"evidence\": [\"names of artifacts/inputs from the pack that support this card\"]\n19\t}\n20\t\n21\tRules:\n22\t\n23\t- Ground every entry in the evidence pack. The 'evidence' list must name items that actually appear in the pack.\n24\t- Keep lists short and high-signal (0-6 entries each). Empty arrays are fine where the evidence is silent.\n25\t- No markdown, no commentary — the JSON object only."}